    "note": "The finished design was read from Wichmann’s NC7 drawing. Its band centre lines fit exact square-root-of-two values. The opening shares the Rabat throne-room octagon grid; three further crossing and compass steps complete the different stars and octagonal bands. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
